<span class="eyebrow">ChatGPT 연결 승인</span>
<h1>연결을 승인할까요?</h1>
<p>클라이언트: {{clientName}}</p>
<p class="field-hint">이름은 클라이언트가 제공한 정보입니다. 승인된 계정으로 로그인하면 내 프로젝트에 연결됩니다.</p>
{{^signedInUsername}}{{#googleEnabled}}<form method="post" action="/auth/google">{{> partials/csrf}}<input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="{{returnTo}}"><button class="google-button" type="submit">{{> partials/google-mark}}Google로 계속하기</button></form>{{/googleEnabled}}{{/signedInUsername}}
<form method="post" action="{{authorizationEndpoint}}">
  <input type="hidden" name="transaction" value="{{transaction}}">
  <fieldset class="scope"><legend>요청 권한</legend><ul>{{#scopeItems}}<li><strong>{{title}}</strong><span>{{description}}</span></li>{{/scopeItems}}</ul></fieldset>
  {{#error}}<p id="password-error" class="error-banner" role="alert">{{error}}</p>{{/error}}
  {{#signedInUsername}}<p class="context-message">{{signedInUsername}} 계정으로 연결합니다.</p><input type="hidden" name="authentication" value="session">{{> partials/csrf}}{{/signedInUsername}}
  {{^signedInUsername}}
  <details class="legacy-login" {{#error}}open{{/error}}><summary>기존 비밀번호 계정으로 승인</summary>
  <label for="username">아이디</label>
  <input id="username" type="text" name="username" value="{{username}}" required autocomplete="username" maxlength="40">
  <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
  <input id="password" type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password" maxlength="256" {{#error}}aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="password-error"{{/error}}>
  {{/signedInUsername}}
  <div class="settings-actions"><button class="primary" name="decision" value="allow" type="submit">연결 승인</button><button name="decision" value="deny" type="submit" formnovalidate>취소</button></div>
  <span class="login-note">비밀번호는 연결하는 클라이언트에 전달되지 않습니다.</span>
  {{^signedInUsername}}</details>{{/signedInUsername}}
</form>
<div class="settings-actions"><a href="/signup">계정이 없나요? 회원가입</a></div>
